          <h2>Seal of God vs. Mark of the Beast</h2>
          <p>Two marks. Two kingdoms. Two destinies. Every soul in earth&rsquo;s last generation will receive one or the other.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="compare-grid">
          <div class="compare-card compare-gold">
            <span class="compare-label label-seal">Seal of the Living God</span>
            <h3 style="color:var(--gold-soft)">The Seventh-Day Sabbath</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Written by God&rsquo;s own finger in stone &mdash; Exodus 31:18</li>
              <li>The sign between God and His people forever &mdash; Ezekiel 20:12</li>
              <li>Captain Bates&rsquo; 1849 tract: <em>A Seal of the Living God</em></li>
              <li>Reveals God as Creator &mdash; the memorial of creation</li>
              <li>The 4th commandment &mdash; the heart of the Decalogue</li>
              <li>Those sealed stand on Mt. Zion with the Lamb &mdash; Rev. 14:1</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="compare-card compare-red">
